    {
      "id": "node_main_jsx",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🚀 main.jsx\n**type:** entry_point\n**path:** `frontend/src/main.jsx`\n\nReact app bootstrap.",
      "x": -1490,
      "y": -270,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_app_jsx",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## App.jsx\n**type:** ui\n**path:** `frontend/src/App.jsx`\n\nRoot router, role-based guards, responsive Tailwind navbar (mobile hamburger).",
      "x": -1490,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_tailwind",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Tailwind CSS v3\n**type:** styling\n**files:** `tailwind.config.js`, `postcss.config.js`\n\nMobile-first design system. Custom brand purple + gold palette, animations: scan-line, shake, slide-down, shimmer, bounce-once.",
      "x": -1490,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_axios_client",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## axios.js\n**type:** api\n**path:** `frontend/src/api/axios.js`\n\nBase API client with JWT interceptors.",
      "x": -1170,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_custom_admin",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🛡️ AdminDashboard.jsx\n**type:** ui — CUSTOM ADMIN\n**path:** `frontend/src/pages/AdminDashboard.jsx`\n\nFull custom admin UI replacing Django Admin as primary interface.\n- StatsBar (students/professors/courses/enrollments)\n- DataTable with skeleton rows + optimistic delete\n- NestedAssignModal 3-step wizard\n- Enrollment via dropdown form (student+course+semester)",
      "x": -1490,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_nested_assign",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🔗 NestedAssignModal.jsx\n**type:** ui component\n**path:** `frontend/src/components/admin/NestedAssignModal.jsx`\n\n3-step wizard: Department → Course → Professor.\nUses `POST /api/courses/admin/nested-assign/`.\nBackend uses get_or_create for each entity.",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_professor_view",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 👨‍🏫 ProfessorView.jsx\n**type:** ui\n**path:** `frontend/src/pages/ProfessorView.jsx`\n\nBranded gradient header with Arabic greeting.\nLive courses fetch from `/api/accounts/professor/{id}/courses/`.\nCourseCard grid with alternating accent colors + skeleton loaders.",
      "x": -1490,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_student_scan",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 📱 StudentScan.jsx\n**type:** ui\n**path:** `frontend/src/pages/StudentScan.jsx`\n\nPersonalized teal gradient header (Arabic greeting).\nEnrolledCourseCard grid with attendance % progress bars.\nScanRing overlay (BarcodeDetector API).\nFull-screen success/fail animation after scan.",
      "x": -1170,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3"
    },

    {
      "id": "node_manage_py",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🚀 manage.py\n**type:** entry_point\n**path:** `backend/manage.py`\n\nDjango management CLI.",
      "x": -270,
      "y": -270,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_settings",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## settings.py\n**type:** config\n**path:** `backend/config/settings.py`\n\nCore Django configuration.",
      "x": -270,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_nested_assign_api",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🔗 NestedAssignmentCreateView\n**type:** api view\n**path:** `backend/courses/views.py`\n**endpoint:** `POST /api/courses/admin/nested-assign/`\n\nAccepts string names/codes.\nUses NestedCourseAssignmentSerializer with get_or_create chain:\nDepartment → Course → Professor → CourseAssignment (atomic transaction).",
      "x": -270,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_nested_serializer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## NestedCourseAssignmentSerializer\n**type:** serializer\n**path:** `backend/courses/serializers.py`\n\nResolves/creates Dept → Course → Professor chain.\nFull atomic transaction. Returns assignment summary JSON.",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_student_courses_api",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## StudentCoursesView (enhanced)\n**type:** api view\n**path:** `backend/attendance/views.py`\n**endpoint:** `GET /api/student/{id}/courses/`\n\nNow includes per-course:\n- `attended_count`\n- `total_sessions`\n- `attendance_pct`",
      "x": -270,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1"
    },

    {
      "id": "node_postgres",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PostgreSQL 15\n**type:** database\n**image:** `postgres:15-alpine`\n\nContainerized DB service.",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },

